### 36

- **Rule:** In feature `XTheme : FreudTheme()`, declare **semantic colors** as **`val FreudColorScheme.tokenName` with `@Composable get()`** (and `this provides FreudDynamicColor(…)`), not as **`@Composable fun tokenName(): FreudDsToken<Color>`** calling `colorScheme provides …`.
- **Why it exists:** Matches [client/AGENTS.md](../../../client/AGENTS.md) feature theme pattern and [design-system AGENTS.md](../../../client/core/design-system/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/kigya/headway/core/designSystem/AGENTS.md); nested extensions require **`import XTheme.tokenName`** so `Theme.colorScheme.tokenName` resolves at call sites.
- **Bad pattern (short):** `@Composable fun homeBackground() = colorScheme provides FreudDynamicColor(…)`; call sites `HomeTheme.homeBackground().value`.
- **Correct pattern (short):** `val FreudColorScheme.homeBackground @Composable get() = this provides FreudDynamicColor(…)`; `import XTheme.homeBackground`; usage `XTheme.colorScheme.homeBackground` / `.value` where a raw `Color` is needed.

