### 37

- **Rule:** Every **`Freud*` composable UI component** added under `core/design-system/.../component/` must ship with a matching **`component/preview/Freud*Preview.kt`** (light/dark and main variants via `PreviewParameterProvider`), same PR as the component. Non-UI hooks (e.g. `CompositionLocal` holders only) are excluded.
- **Why it exists:** [design-system AGENTS.md](../../../client/core/design-system/src/commonMain/kotlin/dev/kigya/headway/core/designSystem/AGENTS.md) treats previews as the behavioral and visual contract for tokens and variants; missing previews hide regressions and wrong theme mapping.
- **Bad pattern (short):** New `FreudHomeHeader.kt` or `FreudAsyncImage.kt` without `FreudHomeHeaderPreview.kt` / `FreudAsyncImagePreview.kt`.
- **Correct pattern (short):** Add `FreudXPreview.kt` with `FreudXPreviewTheme : FreudTheme()`, `FreudTheme(isDark = case.isDark)`, and cases covering theme × key states per section 7 of the design-system AGENTS.md.

